Inner Circle Preview is an independent community experiment for Hermes Desktop.
It is not affiliated with Nous Research or xAI.

The visual treatment grew from Thomas Bekkers' Hermes Bot Kit (MIT):
https://github.com/thomasbek3/hermes-bot-kit
The applicable copyright and permission notice is retained in LICENSE.

Hermes Desktop provides the SDK, native profiles, conversations and pane layout:
https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent

The included demo uses original geometric SVG illustrations and synthetic text.
It contains no production conversations, personal portraits or profile data.
